        {
          "text": "Ba-Musa a-Aroni bakacita aya maleele oonse kumeso aa-Farao, pele Jehova wakayumya moyo wa-Farao, aboobo taakwe naakaleka bana baIsrayeli kuti bazwe mucisi cakwe.",
